ightly increases stability\n  •  Greatly increases reload speed"},{"name":"Light Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/736b486ddb80beefacb4f09b5ad016eb.png","desc":"Improved reload and range.\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Accurized Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d85024478504205359c7fb52dbc4f6b6.png","desc":"This weapon can fire longer distances.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Tactical Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f0e309a267b25279a871d182f8910bcc.png","desc":"This weapon has multiple tactical improvements.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases magazine size"},{"name":"Drop Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d19f0c349652f0285bb5f999307b8a1.png","desc":"Increases reload speed but reduces magazine size."},{"name":"Steady Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6c6e1cc341487a8afd0b0c714a229255.png","desc":"This magazine is optimized for recoil control.\n  •  Greatly increases stability \n  •  Slightly decreases range\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Overflow","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3165fec56b59363fa974a11f5730f4ec.png","desc":"Picking up Special or Heavy ammo automatically loads this weapon beyond normal capacity."},{"name":"Killing Wind","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/db2aa71ff6d808929bb0e668dcf0822e.png","desc":"Final blows grant increased mobility, weapon range, and handling for a short duration."},{"name":"Feeding Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/89d7e65f5ebe8d291ea96f128765921d.png","desc":"Each rapid kill with this weapon progressively increases reload speed for a short time."},{"name":"Tunnel Vision","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ab0837be56c8d5cfc474acd4f3f9c7ac.png","desc":"Reloading after defeating a target greatly increases target acquisition and aim down sight speed for a short duration."},{"name":"Surplus","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a4c054c3547840300b9ce7ef11b7b6fc.png","desc":"Increases handling, reload speed, and stability for each fully charged ability."},{"name":"Subsistence","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/eaa8f4295a71bf47df7ffd8599f7af4d.png","desc":"Defeating targets partially reloads the magazine from reserves."},{"name":"Grave Robber","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/043d100167af67d6041719044a033221.png","desc":"Melee final blows or dealing damage with a charged melee reloads this weapon's magazine from reserves."},{"name":"Quickdraw","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6893bb2c7ec7d13cb0d91ec9dd8b6500.png","desc":"This weapon can be drawn unbelievably fast."},{"name":"Rangefinder","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/74270d52bec24f1f5f4c987f5f37fce9.png","desc":"Aiming this weapon increases its effective range and zoom magnification. Increased projectile velocity while aiming Rocket Launchers, Grenade Launchers, and Bows."},{"name":"Threat Detector","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9611bdbc48aff898193fd5f705c7cf30.png","desc":"Increased reload, stability, and handling when enemies are in close proximity."},{"name":"Moving Target","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40b591eae7f122fdf1cfca21fc6f6c0f.png","desc":"Increased movement speed and target acquisition when moving while aiming down sights."},{"name":"Encore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/857b00161b9794fdd62261adf02c6a5e.png","desc":"Final blows grant a stacking stability, range, and accuracy bonus to this weapon. Precision final blows grant more stacks."},{"name":"Light Touch","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/46b000a4e8c4ffa73df16c26a63360e0.png","desc":"This weapon gains reload speed, handling, and aim down sight speed when you are amplified, radiant, or have Devour."},{"name":"Recycled Energy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c42c7a489769ae6f2d7f84be17c5732b.png","desc":"Reloading after defeating targets grants energy to your lowest charged ability."},{"name":"Heal Clip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3d0f2eb4c1e4f66f2bd897ec4d5ce4f1.png","desc":"Reloading shortly after dealing a final blow grants Cure to you and your nearby allies."},{"name":"Demolitionist","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/da009697110e06b65d6f827b3b6d5f70.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon generate grenade energy. Activating your grenade ability reloads this weapon from reserves."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Adrenaline Junkie","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6f8bde03140b53e6dc583ada1aeaa51d.png","desc":"This weapon gains increased damage and handling from final blows with grenades or this weapon."},{"name":"Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/23e06f4ced1b3e6476f342978ff5bb37.png","desc":"Being in combat for an extended time increases damage, handling, and reload for this weapon until you are out of combat."},{"name":"High-Impact Reserves","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/33ed859a08f2ccf643a1ac3c7f201966.png","desc":"Rounds at the end of the magazine deal more damage."},{"name":"Harmony","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a3c1c5e1cb05adef7cf6af6602a0da0.png","desc":"Final blows with other weapons improve this weapon's damage and performance for a short duration."},{"name":"Elemental Capacitor","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e455d94dcafdab7a0d5a850712908020.png","desc":"Increased stats based on the currently equipped Super.\n• [Solar] increases your reload speed.\n• [Arc] increases handling.\n• [Void] increases stability.\n• [Stasis] moderately controls recoil and increases movement speed when aiming down sights.\n• [Strand] increases airborne effectiveness."},{"name":"Kill Clip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0afd4799427004b2d8170ab213a2ef0c.png","desc":"Reloading after a kill grants increased damage."},{"name":"Wellspring","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ec2e3096ebd447bd6137735c9067b991.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon generate ability energy. This energy is divided between your uncharged abilities."},{"name":"Swashbuckler","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/42631a4aff4432e794529a5a707eba61.png","desc":"This weapon gains increased damage from melee kills and kills with this weapon."},{"name":"Surrounded","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/979881b68ca7839267c9aef5aea2b0ce.png","desc":"This weapon gains bonus damage when three or more enemies are in close proximity."},{"name":"Unrelenting","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/1e5843177c71ae3f2a4770d01a2f3813.png","desc":"Rapidly defeating targets triggers health regeneration. Guardians and powerful combatants count as more than one kill."},{"name":"Thresh","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7f9dcf3bd4a8a4e0d2d0922827f038c9.png","desc":"Killing combatants with this weapon generates a small amount of Super energy."},{"name":"Snapshot Sights","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ce16c9e2cbd73bb548af3e15bdfc7177.png","desc":"Faster time to aim down sights."},{"name":"Feeding Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/89d7e65f5ebe8d291ea96f128765921d.png","desc":"Each rapid kill with this weapon progressively increases reload speed for a short time."},{"name":"Meganeura","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b5378713f840558b0641deb21bbe6c08.png","desc":"Precision final blows create an elemental damage explosion that deals more damage based on the number of rapid precision hits dealt beforehand."},{"name":"Binary Orbit","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/1efa3bc1f9622f08f7d2461f2fb080f9.png","desc":"Elemental final blows opposite this weapon increase damage for a short duration. Darkness final blows boost Arc, Solar, and Void weapons. Light final blows boost Stasis, Strand, and Kinetic weapons."},{"name":"Incandescent","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/22ed4a2cd5a0eb129a14ce77db49373f.png","desc":"Defeating a target spreads scorch to those nearby.\nMore powerful combatants and opposing Guardians cause scorch in a larger radius."}]},{"label":"Origin Trait","weight":0.5,"perks":[{"name":"Vanguard's Vindication","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c7feebe5d55e4611c5d031d50eaca7ed.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon grant a small amount of health."},{"name":"Suros Synergy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/49a2da0bae3d3c2c737e85a374ccdaa6.png","desc":"Reloading grants this weapon bonus handling and reduces incoming flinch for a short time."},{"name":"Accelerated Assault","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0fe2a63b375af0d8b17ccee5ad65415b.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage with this weapon loads a small amount of ammo from reserves, or removes heat, and slightly increases damage."},{"name":"Vanguard Determination","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0eac4566f9f8eb2179d2734e886f958e.png","desc":"After using your class ability, final blows with this weapon grant you bonus damage resistance."}]}],"notes":["[YeezyGT's S16] [MW: Range] \"Punching Out ships with some lethal combos, such as Overflow/Subsistence and Surrounded, Threat Detector, Frenzy, Swashbuckler... Nailing down a decent roll of this isn't easy, with a whopping 12 perks in each column. Are Sidearms that viable in endgame? They've had some niche usage in CQC Lost Sectors with Unstoppable Sidearm - they've got potential if we see some real close-quarters encounters with tougher enemies. Until then, its worth keeping one in your back pocket.\" tags:pve","Inspired by Destiny Massive Breakdowns from Podcast 235. PvP first choice roll. Suros Rapid Fire sidearm subtype is a bit of a sleeper as as Season 15, or you want to stray off-meta a bit. Recommended MW: Stabilty or Reload Speed.","Inspired by Destiny Massive Breakdowns from Podcast 235. PvP backup roll. Suros Rapid Fire sidearm subtype is a bit of a sleeper as as Season 15, or you want to stray off-meta a bit. Recommended MW: Stabilty or Reload Speed.","Inspired by Destiny Massive Breakdowns from Podcast 235. PvP backup roll for melee builds to proc Swashbuckler. Suros Rapi